# Example: test_reactive.wcn

`$Time` wires Time.subscribe(Game). Both classes define identity `update` so notify and the tick loop have something to call.

## Schema

```
Game = $Time
Time = Int/t
```

## Construction

```
[:Game [:Time 0]]
```

## Methods

```
Time::update! = { [:Time t] }
Game::update! = { [:Game time] }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var game = GameAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(game.toConstruction(0, helper));
    game.time.update_mutates();
    trace(game.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
